<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Prosperous - (built 1990) 149,498 dwt sold to Italian buyers for $25 million with timecharter to April 1997 at $18,300 per day.</p>
<p>Saikai Maru - (built 1980) 80,170 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $5.75 million.</p>
<p>CONTAINERS - Flag Paola - (built 1971) 32,010 dwt sold to Indian breakers for $171 per ldt.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Kobe J - (built 1981) 6,853 dwt plus:</p>
</text>
